														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4511028">
									

<p><strong>Hey wait a minute, this isn't one of my articles!</strong></p>
<p>No, but honestly, fantastic work with this. You use the conprocs to effectively hook the reader, the description elaborates on a lot without beating around the bush, and the exploration / interview logs tell an engaging story.</p>
<p>My crit would be that the &quot;discovery&quot; addendum doesn't really do anything for the narrative. It just states facts we don't necessarily need. Also, I could have used a bit more prose and emotional resonance in the final interview. This person has had an intensely therapeutic experience, letting go of pain from the past and moving forward towards healthier relationships. I just don't feel that change in their tone and body language right now. It could be easily remedied with some quick changes to the dialogue, and a few additional notes on their movement / speech patterns. Illustrate for us!</p>
<p>Either way, +1. I'm very impressed, and hope to see more!</p>

